00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:08.898
Kirara Mitsuboshi L.ove Diagnosis ...love
diagnostic software! Finding your love...

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:09.115
Kirara Mitsuboshi Love
Diagnosis Finding your love...

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:13.836
Once I input all the data
I've collected on the girls...

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:17.990
