00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:43.787
It's done-

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:44.816
What?

00:03:46.192 --> 00:03:46.602
My best match at Otowanomori Nishi High is...

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:48.237
YOUR IDEAL PARTNER IS...
My best match at Otowanomori Nishi High is...

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:50.491
My best match at Otowanomori Nishi High is...

