00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.694
Yumi! How would you know?

00:04:29.869 --> 00:04:32.531
Erika and I have been
friends since middle school.

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:34.937
<i>| know what Kind of guys she likes.</i>

