00:05:11.678 --> 00:05:14.323
Sorry! Forgive me Kurumizawa!

00:05:14.347 --> 00:05:17.373
"Kurumizawa" my ass!
It's too late to be polite!

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:27.787
What is it, Yumi?

00:05:28.294 --> 00:05:30.023
