00:05:30.229 --> 00:05:32.630
No particular reason.

00:05:32.765 --> 00:05:35.132
Liar. I can tell you're hiding something.

00:05:36.936 --> 00:05:37.562
You can tell?

00:05:38.071 --> 00:05:38.799
Of course!

00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:40.472
Hey, if it isn't Yumi!

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:43.072
What a coincidence!

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:45.854
| wanted some tea so I stopped by.

00:05:45.878 --> 00:05:47.312
