00:05:53.119 --> 00:05:55.713
He's my classmate, Makoto Kurumizawa.

00:05:55.955 --> 00:05:58.617
This is Erika Kawai, second year class two.

00:05:58.725 --> 00:06:01.660
Erika? What a cute name.

00:06:01.728 --> 00:06:02.354
Nice to meet you.

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:04.420
What terrible acting...

00:06:05.865 --> 00:06:06.798
Nice to meet you, too.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.562
So, you're an only child?

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:11.227
