00:06:26.319 --> 00:06:28.686
Music! I see, music!

00:06:28.821 --> 00:06:33.068
Well, I just happen to have
three tickets to a concert!

00:06:33.092 --> 00:06:34.184
Why don't we go?

00:06:34.394 --> 00:06:36.761
Hey, why do I have to go?

00:06:37.096 --> 00:06:39.622
