No, it's fine, it's fine! Don't worry about me.

00:14:35.441 --> 00:14:37.432
It's fine. What are friends for?

00:14:38.911 --> 00:14:39.844
Thanks.

00:14:40.479 --> 00:14:41.489
You're leaving already?

00:14:41.513 --> 00:14:43.825
Yeah, I'm meeting up with Aki.

00:14:43.849 --> 00:14:45.283
| see. I'll see you later.

00:14:51.423 --> 00:14:55.018
That's not true. I watch television.

00:14:56.095 --> 00:14:58.689
Yumi was lying to me again?

00:15:00.065 --> 00:15:02.090
| heard you take violin lessons.

00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:04.836
No, I stopped playing violin.

00:15:05.004 --> 00:15:06.233
Entrance exams are coming up.

00:15:23.222 --> 00:15:25.657
Hey Yumi, what do you think of this color?

00:15:26.992 --> 00:15:31.862
That's not really me, I'll just buy some lip gloss.

00:15:32.064 --> 00:15:35.090
Really? I think it'll look cute.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.335
| wonder who it is?

00:15:40.105 --> 00:15:44.042
Yumi? I was thinking about giving Erika a gift.

00:15:44.343 --> 00:15:46.675
What do you think she'd like-

00:15:47.146 --> 00:15:49.911
Hey. What's going on between those two?

00:15:49.982 --> 00:15:50.972
| don't Know.

00:15:51.083 --> 00:15:53.108
| thought you were helping him out?

00:15:53.285 --> 00:15:56.298
You've got to be Kidding me. No way.

00:15:56.322 --> 00:15:58.416
Oh. That's boring.

00:16:03.896 --> 00:16:04.863
| see...

00:16:04.997 --> 00:16:08.524
Yeah, so I promised him
I'd go on a date with him.

00:16:09.001 --> 00:16:12.096
But, I'm glad you don't hate him.

00:16:12.338 --> 00:16:13.828
Yeah... yeah...

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.739
I'll talk to you soon.

00:16:15.975 --> 00:16:17.409
Okay... see you.

00:16:41.367 --> 00:16:42.698
Kurumizawa

00:16:44.436 --> 00:16:45.080
Make sure you read it. Yumi

00:16:45.104 --> 00:16:45.947
Make sure you read
it. Yumi What's this??

00:16:45.971 --> 00:16:46.199
Make sure you read it. Yumi

00:17:10.863 --> 00:17:11.830
Kurumizawa!

00:17:13.198 --> 00:17:14.063
Erika!

00:17:14.366 --> 00:17:15.477
Did I keep you waiting?

00:17:15.501 --> 00:17:16.559
Not at all.

00:17:45.998 --> 00:17:48.467
I've seen them before,
but sea otters sure are big.

00:17:48.734 --> 00:17:51.328
| imagined them to be this big.

00:17:52.371 --> 00:17:53.338
You came here before?

00:17:53.439 --> 00:17:54.804
Yeah, with Yumi.

00:17:55.174 --> 00:17:56.801
With Yumi? I see...

00:17:57.443 --> 00:17:58.410
That's right!

00:17:59.445 --> 00:18:00.844
This is for you.

00:18:02.314 --> 00:18:03.076
For me?

00:18:04.016 --> 00:18:04.710
What is it?

00:18:08.787 --> 00:18:09.913
It's so cute!

00:18:10.089 --> 00:18:11.352
| heard you like cats.

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:13.015
| do. Thank you!

00:18:14.293 --> 00:18:15.570
I'm surprised you knew.

00:18:15.594 --> 00:18:16.425
Well, you know...

00:18:17.996 --> 00:18:19.589
Who's calling me now?

00:18:21.433 --> 00:18:23.162
Sorry, I'll be right back.

00:18:32.277 --> 00:18:32.869
Hello?

00:18:32.945 --> 00:18:34.106
Hey, Makoto?

00:18:34.546 --> 00:18:35.623
Yoshihiko.

00:18:35.647 --> 00:18:40.244
Where do they sell that love
diagnostic software you had?

00:18:41.487 --> 00:18:43.819
This isn't the time to be discussing this!

00:18:44.022 --> 00:18:48.357
Come on. I don't know anyone
else who knows computers.

00:18:48.961 --> 00:18:50.429
Where are you right now?

00:19:07.312 --> 00:19:10.111
Cat items are good. I'll kill
you if you make Erika cryll

00:19:11.283 --> 00:19:12.045
Yumi...

00:19:24.229 --> 00:19:25.287
I'm so stupid...

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.626
He couldn't check before he left? Jeez...

00:19:32.704 --> 00:19:33.694
Where's Erika?

00:19:35.974 --> 00:19:37.908
Erika? Erika?

00:19:38.544 --> 00:19:39.602
Erika!

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:45.039
I hate you.

00:20:20.018 --> 00:20:21.076
Makoto.

00:20:40.839 --> 00:20:41.567
Want some?

00:20:42.741 --> 00:20:43.537
| baked them.

00:20:51.984 --> 00:20:52.576
Autumn.

00:20:53.819 --> 00:20:59.758
They say leaves fall from the
branches to give way to new leaves.

00:21:01.526 --> 00:21:04.496
No matter how lonesome you feel
seeing the leaves fall...

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:08.065
...hew leaves will return in the spring.

00:21:09.001 --> 00:21:10.059
They're pretty good.

00:21:12.971 --> 00:21:13.802
The cookies.

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:19.306
Yeah.

00:21:22.748 --> 00:21:28.949
Perhaps the emptiness left in your heart
is something similar to the falling leaves.

00:21:31.823 --> 00:21:34.520
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:21:34.726 --> 00:21:40.426
we're just happy when we're together
issho nara ureshiku nattari

00:21:41.099 --> 00:21:49.099
Somehow we connect, everyone together
Nanto naku tsuuji au minna ga ii ne

00:21:57.449 --> 00:22:02.410
We lay down on the riverbed
Kawara no shamen nekoron da

00:22:02.688 --> 00:22:05.555
stretching our arms and legs
teashi wo nobashite

00:22:06.758 --> 00:22:14.563
Birds flew above our heads
Atama no ue wo tori tachi ga tobitatta

00:22:16.034 --> 00:22:20.562
I just look up at the sky
Futo miageta kyou no sora

00:22:20.772 --> 00:22:23.673
it seems to spread forever
doko mademo hirogaru

00:22:24.242 --> 00:22:29.457
All the things bothering me
Donna yuutsu na koto demo

00:22:29.481 --> 00:22:34.282
<i>seem so small
chiisaku omoeru yo</i>

00:22:37.055 --> 00:22:39.901
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:22:39.925 --> 00:22:45.887
we just sing our favorite songs
suki na uta kuchi zusande tari

00:22:46.331 --> 00:22:54.331
That's the best, that's when it feels great
Sonna toki ga ichiban kimochi ga ii ne

